# Import and share

- Rule matching lives in `share/ShareDomainRules.kt` (`RouterRules`, `ParseRules`, `UrlDetector`);
  add a `ShareRouterTest` case for every matching change.
- Rule JSON is hand-rolled (`ShareJson`). A new rule field needs the model, encode, decode and the
  editor; read new fields with defaults. Alpha: no legacy readers.
- Keep `RouterRules.withPluginHosts` behavior (plugin rules before `seed-url-any`).
- `ShareRouter.decide` stays pure. Import execution is in `LibraryViewModel`, not `share/`.
- Shares reach the Library only through `FlowApp.shareInbox`; never put them in intents.
- HTML to paragraphs: `share/HtmlParagraphs.kt` is the owner; don't add another extractor.
- Owners: positions `data/ProgressWriter.kt`; logging `debug/DebugLog.kt`; settings keys
  `data/SettingsStore.kt`.

Before changing a file here, run `rg -n '<FileName>' docs/agent/seams.md`.

Entries: `docs/agent/registry.md` (Import). Behavior: `docs/import-share.md`. History:
`../flow-reader-chats/areas/import.md`.
